  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2019-06-20T17:24:40.715Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I would like to have a app for VRCHAT, it’s  features would consist of the following: 1. Send friend requests and accept requests also, when sending a request the one sending the request can leave a message along with it. This would make things easier for people who want to get in contact with a avatar creator and ask if they willing to sell a avatar to them. (Some creators don’t leave any contact info)\n2. Friend activity mentor \n the feature will allow you to see if your friend is online and what world the are currently in(basically the same thing you can do in the menu but mobile) and the app can send notifications when your friends are online, that’s if you want the app too do so .this way people don’t have to go on and off VRCHAT  just to check if their friend is on. I would find this app useful and I’m sure other players would too.",
